---
title: Deployment topology
---
%% Source of truth: deploy/docker/compose.yml and its overlays.
%% CI asserts every Felix service waits on `migrate` (scripts/check-compose-render.py).
flowchart TB
    accTitle: What runs where in a Felix deployment, and what each part needs
    accDescr: Three Felix processes share one image and one database. The API serves every protocol surface; the worker executes periodic tasks; the scheduler holds the cron labels and does nothing else — omit it and no task ever fires. A one-shot migrate container runs Alembic to head and every other service waits for it to complete, which CI asserts against the rendered compose config rather than trusting the YAML. Postgres with pgvector is the system of record; Valkey carries the broker, rate limits, run queues, steering and cross-replica session wakes. The object store is pluggable and defaults to the filesystem, so the base stack pulls no cloud SDK.

    subgraph edge["Public edge"]
        lb([TLS terminator or CDN])
    end

    subgraph felix["Felix services — one image, four commands"]
        direction TB
        migrate["migrate<br/>felix migrate head"]
        api["api<br/>felix-api on Granian :8080"]
        worker["worker<br/>felix-worker"]
        sched["scheduler<br/>felix-scheduler"]
    end

    subgraph state["Stateful dependencies"]
        direction LR
        pg[("Postgres + pgvector<br/>system of record")]
        cache[("Valkey / Redis<br/>broker, leases, rate limits")]
        obj[("Object store<br/>fs, S3, or GCS")]
    end

    lb -->|"HTTPS to /chat, /v1, /a2a, /mcp"| api
    migrate -->|"every service waits on completion"| api
    migrate --> worker
    migrate --> sched

    api -->|"reads and writes session, audit, usage"| pg
    worker --> pg
    sched -->|"enqueues cron tasks"| cache
    cache --> worker
    api -->|"run queues, steer, cross-replica wake"| cache
    api -->|"manifest bundles, artifact spill"| obj
    worker --> obj

    api -->|"outbound HTTPS, egress-guarded"| models([Model providers, MCP servers, A2A peers])

    class migrate focal
    class api focal
    class lb,models external
    class worker,sched primary
    class pg,cache,obj store

    classDef focal    fill:#dbeaf5,stroke:#0072B2,stroke-width:2px,color:#062033
    classDef primary  fill:#f4f6f9,stroke:#5a6272,stroke-width:1px,color:#10203a
    classDef external fill:#ffffff,stroke:#767676,stroke-width:1px,stroke-dasharray:4 3,color:#3b414d
    classDef store    fill:#f4f6f9,stroke:#4a7a52,stroke-width:1px,color:#14261a
    style edge fill:none,stroke:#c3c9d4,stroke-width:1px,color:#3b414d
    style felix fill:none,stroke:#c3c9d4,stroke-width:1px,color:#3b414d
